<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>some.pics (中文)</title><link>https://some.pics</link><description>只是网上的一些图片。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 02:54:37 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>草丛中的奇异粉花</title><link>https://some.pics/6a9e276a17086</link><description>&lt;p&gt;这是我在一片草丛里发现的一朵奇怪的小粉花。它有好几个不太一样的花蕾——如果那也能叫花蕾的话。每朵花从白色渐变为橙粉色，非常漂亮。

这花特别小，大概只有我小指第一节指节那么大。我是用手机上的微距模式拍的，所以背景里其余的草都虚化了。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="This is a strange pink flower I found in the grass. It has quite a few different flower buds if you can call them that. Each flower goes from a white to an orangey-pink colour. They are quite beautiful.

It's quite tiny, about the size of the first knuckle of my pinky. I took the photo using the macro setting on my phone, so the rest of the grass in the background is out of focus." height="3072" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/shroomy/6a9e276a17086.jpg" width="4080"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://shroomy.some.pics"&gt;@shroomy&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 02:54:37 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>这是我在地上发现的一朵紫粉色小花。它非常小，只有我小指甲的一半大小。我用手机上的微距模式拍了这张照片，所以背景里的其他草都虚化了。</title><link>https://some.pics/6a9e26e902b19</link><description>&lt;p&gt;这是我在地上发现的一朵紫粉色小花。它非常小，只有我小指甲的一半大小。我用手机上的微距模式拍了这张照片，所以背景里的其他草都虚化了。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="This is a small purpley-pink flower I found in the grass. It's quite tiny, just barely the half the size of my pinky nail. I took the photo using the macro setting on my phone, so the rest of the grass in the background is out of focus." height="1918" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/shroomy/6a9e26e902b19.jpg" width="2547"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://shroomy.some.pics"&gt;@shroomy&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 02:52:28 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>草丛中的小黄花</title><link>https://some.pics/6a9e257a548d6</link><description>&lt;p&gt;这是我在草丛里发现的一朵小黄花。它非常小，只有我小指甲盖那么大。这张照片是用手机微距模式拍的，所以背景中的其他草都虚化了。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="This is a small yellow flower I found in the grass. It's quite tiny, just barely the size of my pinky nail. I took the photo using the macro setting on my phone, so the rest of the grass in the background is out of focus." height="3072" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/shroomy/6a9e257a548d6.jpg" width="4080"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://shroomy.some.pics"&gt;@shroomy&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 02:46:22 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>柏林胜利柱日落</title><link>https://some.pics/6a9da07adae20</link><description>&lt;p&gt;胜利纪念柱，日落，柏林（2012年）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Siegessäule, sunset, Berlin (2012)" height="2230" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hiddenflair/6a9da07adae20.jpg" width="3965"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hiddenflair.some.pics"&gt;@hiddenflair&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 17:18:54 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>巧妙柜子黄花钱包</title><link>https://some.pics/6a9d9626c48aa</link><description>&lt;p&gt;精巧柜橱：一枝黄花守护荷包。

