<pubDate>Sat, 05 Sep 2026 19:02:22 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>发光鞋毁了</title><link>https://some.pics/6a9c5556cfb68</link><description>&lt;p&gt;可怜的发光鞋毁了…😭&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A person's bright yellow running shoes stand on wet concrete, with mud splattered across the toe of the right shoe." height="2371" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/ericmwalk/6a9c5556cfb68.jpg" width="3161"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://ericmwalk.some.pics"&gt;@ericmwalk&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 05 Sep 2026 17:46:02 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>阴天未雨的小遗憾</title><link>https://some.pics/6a9c44f91752f</link><description>&lt;p&gt;真希望当时能下点雨而不是只是阴天，不过那也没关系。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A concrete and metal path with stepped edges runs alongside a dark pond and a wide green field, bordered by dense trees under an overcast sky." height="4284" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/ericmwalk/6a9c44f91752f.jpg" width="5712"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://ericmwalk.some.pics"&gt;@ericmwalk&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 05 Sep 2026 16:36:17 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>